        <briefdescription>
<para>REL (variable_step) knob: momentum filter + speed-up. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>controlId</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>DCSIN_* or CTRL_* constant. Determines <ref refid="namespacePanelBridge" kindref="compound">PanelBridge</ref> routing. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>pinA</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>quadrature channel A. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>pinB</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>quadrature channel B (swap A/B to reverse the sensed direction). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>stepsPerDetent</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>quadrature transitions per emitted click (match the encoder). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>step</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>REL magnitude for a normal detent (DCS suggested_step is 3200). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>fastStep</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>REL magnitude for a fast detent, same sign as <computeroutput>step</computeroutput> (e.g. 4× step). 0 turns the speed-up off, leaving only the filter. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
