        <briefdescription>
<para>Momentum filter only — for DIR (fixed_step) selectors. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>mode</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para><ref refid="namespaceOpenSkyhawk_1a37a6ae1d794d8c3a166703b9250301c6a3c4e6dbf3e1df93a734d9959bac9ee94" kindref="member">EncoderMode::Dir</ref>. Passing <ref refid="namespaceOpenSkyhawk_1a37a6ae1d794d8c3a166703b9250301c6aeba991d56b1be0b940d722211bab87bc" kindref="member">EncoderMode::Rel</ref> here gives a REL knob with the filter and no speed-up (use the other constructor to set <computeroutput>fastStep</computeroutput>). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
